# Cast form of tools/check_stinking_cloud_dc.sh (bd inc-s64e): the loaded elf
# mage learns Stinking Cloud, casts it at a square beside himself, and stands
# in it for several rounds. Each round's Fortitude save lands in
# logs/chance_probe.log (INCURSION_CHANCE_PROBE). The fixture already has
# wizard mode, Infinite Mana and Freeze Monsters on; Cheat Death goes on here.
# SPACE clears the "Welcome back" -- more -- prompt (ESC would open the System
# Menu).
SPACE
w
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
SPACE           # Cheat Death: NO -> YES
ESC
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC
w
@choose "Learn Any Spell"
"Stinking Cloud" ENTER

@until "Select Spell" m
@choose "Stinking Cloud"
@dump:cast-aim
RIGHT*2
ENTER
@dump:cast-done
SPACE
@dump:cast-after
s*12
@dump:cast-rounds
@quit
